       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Dan Field",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "timeZone": "Europe/London"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Testing the following setup on OS X 13.0.1",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "$ java --version\njava 17.0.5 2022-10-18 LTS\nJava(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 17.0.5+9-LTS-191)\nJava HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 17.0.5+9-LTS-191, mixed mode, sharing)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "$ bin/startup.sh\nUsing CATALINA_BASE:   /Users/dof/Development/Source/apache-tomcat-9.0.70\nUsing CATALINA_HOME:   /Users/dof/Development/Source/apache-tomcat-9.0.70\nUsing CATALINA_TMPDIR: /Users/dof/Development/Source/apache-tomcat-9.0.70/temp\nUsing JRE_HOME:        /Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/jdk-17.0.5.jdk/Contents/Home\nUsing CLASSPATH:       /Users/dof/Development/Source/apache-tomcat-9.0.70/bin/bootstrap.jar:/Users/dof/Development/Source/apache-tomcat-9.0.70/bin/tomcat-juli.jar\nUsing CATALINA_OPTS:\nTomcat started.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "war file deploys successfully with only a single exception which I beleive is unrelated here. This appears to relate to Tomcats bootstrap attempting to restore session data from a persistant store which does not exist. Red Herring as far as we are concerned I think.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Browsing the webapp, I can crfeate resources, view version history and delete containers. I can search successfully ffrom the search page. I used the sample tomcat-users from the documentation without any modification. ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Adding Java 17 to the CI testing matrix as per ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3867"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " will allow for deeper testing",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
